WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
[soft music]

2
00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.750
<v Her>Hey Tailzu, umm, tell him I'll be like...

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.820
<v Her>twenty minutes late, metro is packed,

4
00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.810
<v Her>and ask him to order the paneer thing for me,

5
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.300
<v Her>make it sweet, not like I'm annoyed,

6
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.060
<v Her>and add a heart.

7
00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.410
[the message writes itself]

8
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.060
[sent]

9
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.260
[a reply arrives]

